Description: Qualcomm smart video encoder control library - development files
 This package contains the development headers and files for the
 libqimsdk-smartvenc library.
 .
 Install this package to develop applications using the smart video encoder
 control API.

Package: libqimsdk-smartvenc1
Section: libs
Architecture: arm64
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: Qualcomm smart video encoder control library
 This library provides adaptive video encoder control algorithms for Qualcomm
 IoT platforms. It analyzes incoming video frames to dynamically adjust
 H.264 and H.265 encoder parameters based on scene content and motion levels,
 including bitrate, frame rate, and GOP length. It also supports Region of
 Interest (ROI) quality control using ML-provided object detection data.
